@startuml
title Farm Management System - State Diagram

[*] --> Login

state "Login" as Login
state MainArea
state MarketConditions
state MarketReport
state PestControlHelp
state Techniques
state SoilInfo
state WeatherInsights
state LabourAvailability
state ServiceContinue
state Logout

Login --> MainArea : Successful Login
MainArea --> MarketConditions : User selects market conditions
MarketConditions --> MarketReport
MainArea --> PestControlHelp : User selects pest control help
PestControlHelp --> Techniques : Requires photo

SoilInfo --> SuitableCrops
WeatherInsights --> WeatherDetails
LabourAvailability --> LabourDetails

MainArea --> ServiceContinue : User continues using the service
Logout --> EndSession : User logs out
@enduml
